('llama-gemma','Pinned llama.cpp Gemma 4 architecture source','https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/9b8446b91434e0c0cdc293baf0b29c099eaaa0c7/src/models/gemma4.cpp','Architecture implementation at named source commit','Source presence does not prove conversion/device/runtime compatibility'),
('llama-quantize','Pinned llama.cpp quantization documentation','https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/9b8446b91434e0c0cdc293baf0b29c099eaaa0c7/tools/quantize/README.md','Quantizer workflow and preset names','Conditional future protocol; no model conversion executed'),
